        "Combat-power coefficients separate displayed power from actual rhythm yield and the source's skill-compensation decision."
      ],
      "diagram_findings": [
        "Basic flow checks combat termination before the combat, skill, and damage flows on every turn; combat leave happens only after the result branch.",
        "The illustrated skill flow contains target iteration, hit-gated caster/target buffs, buff recording, reactive handling, and post-turn cleanup.",
        "The illustrated damage flow has evade as an immediate exit, then critical and resistance branches that rejoin damage calculation before bleed and death-dependent branches.",
        "The global allocation diagram requires equal total allocation across the primary attack, defense, and HP attributes to preserve lower balance; it does not require all attribute columns together to total 100%.",
        "The level-benchmark figure shows that the benchmark mapping determines whether a route is linear, diminishing-return, or segmented in its visible growth rhythm.",
